{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>有「廣告女王」之稱31歲的日本女星川口春奈，今日(11日)更新社交網即時動態，宣布已為29歲日本國腳老公板倉滉誕下第一胎， 母子平安。</p><p>川口未有公布BB的性別及出生日期，但感激外界在她懷孕期間的支持。她於今年7月被爆與板倉拍拖一年，8月初宣布奉子成婚。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T10:16:24.640318+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":134,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T09:40:22+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T10:17:26.055765+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T10:09:38.047523+00:00","content_hash":"9d988837e784e84bca53efa023ab27773b5d4246256fc576013c0313869122d1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-11T10:16:24.640318+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}